**DPC Impact Hub**

Project Handoff & Continuation Guide

Graeme Wright · Digital Pedagogy Coach · Weston College Group · May 2026

*This document covers: what has been built, what remains, how to continue, and how to integrate the Evidence Hub, DevObs, and Quality team workflows.*

# **1. What Is Built**

The DPC Impact Hub is a password-protected, browser-based application hosted on GitHub Pages. All live data stays in your browser (localStorage) with a manual download backup workflow. No sensitive data lives on GitHub.

Repository: gwc25/dpc-impact-hub → https://gwc25.github.io/dpc-impact-hub/

