# **6. Deployment Checklist**

Before going live, complete these steps in order:

- 1. Set password: go to https://emn178.github.io/online-tools/sha256.html → generate hash → replace placeholder in index.html → push.

- 2. Push all files to gwc25/dpc-impact-hub on GitHub. Make sure hc-schema.json is included in data/.

- 3. Open https://gwc25.github.io/dpc-impact-hub/ → sign in → verify all 35 areas load correctly.

- 4. Click ⬇ Save → dpc-data.json downloads → move to Documents/DPC-Hub-Data/.

- 5. Verify import works: Settings → Import dpc-data.json → confirm data loads.

- 6. Run: git rm data/areas-seed.json → git commit -m "Remove seed data after initial load" → git push.

- 7. Verify hub still loads correctly from localStorage after seed is removed.

- 8. Consider making the repo private (costs nothing on GitHub if you have a paid plan).

